      "html": "<ul><li><strong>Scientific name:</strong> Farlowella hahni Meinken, 1937</li><li><strong>Common name:</strong> Twig Catfish</li><li><strong>Etymology:</strong> Named after W. G. Farlow, from Harvard University.</li><li><strong>Type locality:</strong> Río Paraná, about 2 kilometres east of Ayolas, Misiones Dept., Paraguay.</li></ul>"
    },
