    {
      "key": "behaviour",
      "source": "planetcatfish",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.planetcatfish.com/common/species.php?species_id=1539",
      "html": "<p>Suggested tankmates: smaller tetras or rasboras are suitably mannered, and perhaps hatchetfish are best. Avoid fast or \"nippy\" fishes such as danios or barbs. Will do well with Corydoras catfish, but larger catfish or cichlids are to be avoided.</p>"
    },
